# With MDL104: the final newline and the value are both added.
-- options --
mydumper-version: v0.19.1-3
select: MDL104, MDL113
-- input.cnf.esc --
[mydumper]\nroutines
-- fixed.cnf --
[mydumper]
routines=1
-- diagnostics --
2:1-2:9 error MDL113[unsupported-flag-without-value] `routines` has no `=`: mydumper v0.19.1-3 hands the file to GLib without rewriting valueless options into `key= 1` (GLib: Key file contains line “routines” which is not a key-value pair, group, or comment)
  = mydumper ignores this entire file: it only logs a WARNING ("Failed to load config file") and runs with its defaults, exit code 0.
  fix (safe): Write the value explicitly (`routines=1`)
2:9-2:9 error MDL104[missing-final-newline] file does not end with a newline
  = Anything appended to this file (for example a [client] section added by a script) is glued to its last line.
  fix (safe): Add a final newline
